     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«とはいえ» acknowledges an idea and limits what can be concluded from it.",
     "texto": [
      "It's equivalent to \"that said\" or \"even so.\" It introduces a reservation, not necessarily a complete contradiction.",
      "べんり に なった。 とは いえ、 すべて の もんだい が なくなった わけ では ない。 (It has become more practical. That said, not all the problems have disappeared.)",
      "けいけん は すくない。 とは いえ、 まなぶ いよく は つよい。 (They have little experience. Even so, their desire to learn is strong.)"
